OL,3,GNEWSAFish company fined after worker
OL,4,Abecomes entangled in machine
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fish processing company in Shetland
OL,7,Fhas been fined after a man was left
OL,8,Fwith life-threatening injuries when he
OL,9,Fbecame entangled in a machine at its
OL,10,FLerwick plant.
OL,12,FCurtis New, a forklift supervisor, was
OL,13,Fclearing a blockage in the palletiser
OL,14,Fmachine on 10 October 2024 when it
OL,15,Frestarted and he was struck repeatedly.
OL,17,FThe 41-year-old was airlifted to
OL,18,Fhospital and suffered multiple
OL,19,Ffractures and two collapsed lungs.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
