OL,3,GNEWSAFish company fined after worker
OL,4,Abecomes entangled in machine
OL,5,
OL,6,FPelagia Shetland Limited, in the
OL,7,FGremista Industrial Estate, pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to health and safety failings
OL,9,Fand was fined #451,500.
